OL,3,GNEWSA'Truly terrible' Christmas tree
OL,4,Areplaced after backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA much-mocked Christmas tree in a town
OL,7,Fcentre has been replaced by a fuller,
OL,8,Fhealthier-looking replacement.
OL,10,FThe original tree in the centre of
OL,11,FDarwen, Lancashire, left councillors
OL,12,Fred-faced after a sparse,
OL,13,Fworse-for-wear fir was installed in the
OL,14,Fmarket square.
OL,16,FThe council joked on social media: "How
OL,17,Fmany times have you ordered something,
OL,18,Fonly for it to arrive and not be quite
OL,19,Fwhat you were expecting?"
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
