OL,3,GNEWSA'Truly terrible' Christmas tree
OL,4,Areplaced after backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Matt Jackson told BBC Radio
OL,7,FLancashire that a local resident first
OL,8,Falerted him to the "sorry" tree,
OL,9,Fsending a picture with the caption
OL,10,F"This is truly terrible".
